{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they shall mourn.</b> Like ואבלו:" "<b>The fishermen.</b> A noun of attribute, like גנבים (Isaiah 23:1):" "<b>Hook.</b> Like בחכה הועלה (Habakkuk 1:15), by which fish are caught. And many derive the word from חיך, and they are far from the way." "<b>Drag-net.</b> A net."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:16.046443085Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}